#. translators: %s: comma-separated plugin names.
msgid "Store Polylang is not running: %s is missing."
msgstr "Store Polylang no está funcionando: falta %s."

#. translators: %s: name of the other plugin.
msgid "Store Polylang is not running: %s already connects Polylang and WooCommerce, and with two of them every sale would leave stock twice. Deactivate one."
msgstr "Store Polylang no está funcionando: %s ya conecta Polylang y WooCommerce, y con los dos cada venta saldría dos veces del stock. Desactiva uno."
